s 5 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle saw 164% of normal in April to May and 45% in November to December. So far in 2026 January to February sat at 23% and June to July at 190% on the middle. Grid 20567 had its driest year in 1963 at 57% of normal.</p>"}
